// cupertino-layers --graph
// 79 crates, 378 internal dependencies
// per layer: foundation 18, models 8, platform 9, protocol 3, transport 3, render 3, ui 13, core 1, shell 11, services 4, apps 2, tools 4
// forbidden dev edge cupertino-menubar (shell) -> cupertino-files (apps), permanent exception (apps): the menu bar's integration test opens and activates the menus the apps publish
// forbidden dev edge cupertino-menubar (shell) -> cupertino-settings (apps), permanent exception (apps): the menu bar's integration test opens and activates the menus the apps publish
// forbidden normal edge cupertino-settings (apps) -> cupertino-alsa (platform), migration #21 exception (services): the sound pane drives the default sink and the mixer itself until audio goes through a service
// forbidden normal edge cupertino-settings (apps) -> cupertino-pipewire (platform), migration #21 exception (services): the sound pane drives the default sink and the mixer itself until audio goes through a service
// forbidden dev edge cupertino-settings (apps) -> cupertino-pipewire (platform), migration #21 exception (services): the sound pane drives the default sink and the mixer itself until audio goes through a service
// denied paths ui -> core, shell, services: none
